cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Agent Boundary Check
message: If you use or adapt this software, please cite it.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Agent Boundary Check measures file access, process execution and network
  reachability through AI coding agents using synthetic canaries. The release
  includes an offline replay, the study protocol and the original Linux and
  macOS calibration records. The macOS pilot measured the Codex sandbox
  command across two pinned CLI versions.
